1
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:04,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[rapid hoofbeats]
-[cart wheels rattling]</b></font>

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

3
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CAPTAIN] Are you sure, sir?
This is far enough?</b></font>

4
00:00:27,070 --> 00:00:28,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[DENKEN] It will do.</b></font>

5
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:31,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can make it
the rest of the way by myself.</b></font>

6
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:33,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is where
our journey must end,</b></font>

7
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:36,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for my journey
continues on foot.</b></font>

8
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:40,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you're certain,
travel safe, sir.</b></font>

9
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:43,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[hoofbeats]
-[cart wheels rattling]</b></font>

10
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

11
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:04,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

12
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's in ruins.</b></font>

13
00:02:51,090 --> 00:02:54,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, it takes time to rebuild
after a dragon attack.</b></font>

14
00:02:54,130 --> 00:02:55,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't realize</b></font>

15
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:57,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you guys had to deal
with dragons up here.</b></font>

16
00:02:57,340 --> 00:02:59,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Plateau's fun never ends.</b></font>

17
00:02:59,810 --> 00:03:01,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It could be much worse,</b></font>

18
00:03:01,100 --> 00:03:02,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-you know.
-How.</b></font>

19
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] When I traveled
with Himmel and the others,</b></font>

20
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:07,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we were attacked
by a thunder of dragons.</b></font>

21
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:10,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can you even imagine
that many in one place?</b></font>

22
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:12,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd rather not.</b></font>

23
00:03:12,530 --> 00:03:15,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, just to clarify,</b></font>

24
00:03:15,070 --> 00:03:17,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>do they not usually move
as a thunder?</b></font>

25
00:03:17,820 --> 00:03:20,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Was this village attacked
by a thunder?</b></font>

26
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAYOR] Yes.</b></font>

27
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:24,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems the beasts have made
a nearby forest their home.</b></font>

28
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:26,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You three are our best shot
at defeating them.</b></font>

29
00:03:27,210 --> 00:03:29,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Normal" around here
isn't very normal.</b></font>

30
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:31,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not normal at all.</b></font>

31
00:03:39,550 --> 00:03:41,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[men grunting]</b></font>

32
00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:52,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your village is
past the point of saving.</b></font>

33
00:03:52,860 --> 00:03:54,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should rebuild
somewhere new.</b></font>

34
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:57,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How could we?</b></font>

35
00:03:57,740 --> 00:03:59,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As dangerous as it is,</b></font>

36
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this is our home.</b></font>

37
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:04,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MAN 1] Incoming.
-[MAN 2] Let me help.</b></font>

38
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:06,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN 3] Need more hands?</b></font>

39
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
He's right, Mistress Frieren.</b></font>

40
00:04:10,460 --> 00:04:13,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was a cruel thing to say.</b></font>

41
00:04:13,090 --> 00:04:15,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Somebody's gotta
help these villagers.</b></font>

42
00:04:15,670 --> 00:04:17,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One dragon
is a challenge enough.</b></font>

43
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:19,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To face a horde...</b></font>

44
00:04:19,550 --> 00:04:21,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We will not come out unscathed.</b></font>

45
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:25,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We protect other people's homes,
don't we?</b></font>

46
00:04:26,230 --> 00:04:28,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It shall depend on the reward.</b></font>

47
00:04:28,730 --> 00:04:31,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Alas, our village
is extremely poor.</b></font>

48
00:04:31,690 --> 00:04:33,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I fear we have
nothing to pay you with.</b></font>

49
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:35,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't have
a single grimoire?</b></font>

50
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:38,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's one,
but it's terribly useless</b></font>

51
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:40,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I doubt
it's of any interest to you.</b></font>

52
00:04:40,450 --> 00:04:42,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It allows you to say
tongue twisters</b></font>

53
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without tripping
over your words.</b></font>

54
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:47,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Goodness, that does sound
terribly useless.</b></font>

55
00:04:52,460 --> 00:04:55,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At the end of the day,
a spell is still a spell.</b></font>

56
00:04:55,550 --> 00:04:58,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You mentioned
they live in a nearby wood?</b></font>

57
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:01,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes, they're somewhere
in that forest up ahead.</b></font>

58
00:05:02,590 --> 00:05:05,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we can pick up
even a trace of mana,</b></font>

59
00:05:06,270 --> 00:05:07,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we can track them down.</b></font>

60
00:05:08,350 --> 00:05:09,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

61
00:05:32,210 --> 00:05:34,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Looks like we continue straight.</b></font>

62
00:05:34,750 --> 00:05:37,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm impressed
by your magic all the time.</b></font>

63
00:05:37,210 --> 00:05:39,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But when it's
so applicable like this,</b></font>

64
00:05:39,670 --> 00:05:41,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm reminded how amazing it is.</b></font>

65
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:44,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you have
any more praise for me?</b></font>

66
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can't give in.</b></font>

67
00:05:46,050 --> 00:05:47,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No more careless praise.</b></font>

68
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:50,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's bad for Mistress Frieren's
development.</b></font>

69
00:05:50,230 --> 00:05:52,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
Hm... I guess that's true.</b></font>

70
00:05:52,270 --> 00:05:55,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] What exactly
do you two take me for?</b></font>

71
00:05:56,900 --> 00:05:59,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If anyone still cares,
the dragons are this way.</b></font>

72
00:05:59,990 --> 00:06:01,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

73
00:06:35,350 --> 00:06:36,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[FRIEREN] There they are.
-[dragons snoring softly]</b></font>

74
00:06:36,980 --> 00:06:38,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
That's a lot of dragons.</b></font>

75
00:06:38,610 --> 00:06:40,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
But luckily they're small.</b></font>

76
00:06:40,690 --> 00:06:43,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They won't be nearly as strong
as that solar dragon.</b></font>

77
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:46,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Regardless of size,
dragons are smart.</b></font>

78
00:06:46,910 --> 00:06:48,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't let them surround you.</b></font>

79
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:51,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I say we draw them
to a single point</b></font>

80
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:52,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and take them down at once.</b></font>

81
00:06:52,750 --> 00:06:54,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, Stark?</b></font>

82
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:55,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Think that you're up
for the job?</b></font>

83
00:06:56,250 --> 00:06:59,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're an experienced
dragon fighter these days.</b></font>

84
00:06:59,130 --> 00:07:00,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tall order.</b></font>

85
00:07:00,590 --> 00:07:02,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>More like experienced bait.</b></font>

86
00:07:04,220 --> 00:07:06,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[dragon growls]</b></font>

87
00:07:07,220 --> 00:07:08,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shall we begin?</b></font>

88
00:07:08,510 --> 00:07:10,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You better actually fire
some spells this time!</b></font>

89
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:12,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

90
00:07:14,230 --> 00:07:16,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you slay them all first,
I won't have to.</b></font>

91
00:07:18,810 --> 00:07:19,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunts]</b></font>

92
00:07:20,690 --> 00:07:22,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[dragons growling]</b></font>

93
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:24,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunting]</b></font>

94
00:07:44,460 --> 00:07:45,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark gasps]</b></font>

95
00:07:45,550 --> 00:07:46,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[dragon growling]</b></font>

96
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

97
00:07:54,270 --> 00:07:55,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunting]</b></font>

98
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:11,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunts]</b></font>

99
00:08:14,910 --> 00:08:16,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark groans]</b></font>

100
00:08:26,470 --> 00:08:29,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That job
was ridiculously intense.</b></font>

101
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:32,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At least the village's church
wasn't destroyed.</b></font>

102
00:08:32,300 --> 00:08:35,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mr. Stark, I watched
an angry dragon</b></font>

103
00:08:35,220 --> 00:08:37,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-chew on your head.
-[dragon grunting]</b></font>

104
00:08:39,020 --> 00:08:41,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] How are you
not in worse shape?</b></font>

105
00:08:41,900 --> 00:08:43,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Uh...</b></font>

106
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:46,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I got no clue.</b></font>

107
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:49,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Eisen's head
was often chewed as well.</b></font>

108
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:52,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Durable skulls must be
a normal warrior trait.</b></font>

109
00:08:52,070 --> 00:08:55,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress, nothing about
Mister Eisen is normal.</b></font>

110
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAYOR] It took some rummaging.</b></font>

111
00:08:59,410 --> 00:09:01,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But here's
the promised grimoire.</b></font>

112
00:09:01,540 --> 00:09:04,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you
for protecting our village.</b></font>

113
00:09:13,850 --> 00:09:16,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've noticed an odd tendency.</b></font>

114
00:09:16,140 --> 00:09:17,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whenever we help someone out,</b></font>

115
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:20,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you almost always
blindly demand payment.</b></font>

116
00:09:20,890 --> 00:09:23,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because Himmel the Hero
did the same.</b></font>

117
00:09:23,150 --> 00:09:24,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's surprising.</b></font>

118
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:27,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Agreed. I imagined him
as the sort that would want</b></font>

119
00:09:27,860 --> 00:09:29,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to help others for free.</b></font>

120
00:09:30,110 --> 00:09:31,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Curious, huh?</b></font>

121
00:09:31,860 --> 00:09:34,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Used to confound me, too.</b></font>

122
00:09:34,620 --> 00:09:37,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you so much
for your help, sir.</b></font>

123
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:39,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WOMAN] I only wish
that there was some way</b></font>

124
00:09:39,330 --> 00:09:41,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for us to properly repay you.</b></font>

125
00:09:41,330 --> 00:09:44,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But as you can see,
our village is poor.</b></font>

126
00:09:44,250 --> 00:09:46,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though we can't offer much,</b></font>

127
00:09:46,040 --> 00:09:48,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I do hope you'll take this.</b></font>

128
00:09:49,170 --> 00:09:50,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN]
I won't allow it, Himmel.</b></font>

129
00:09:51,010 --> 00:09:53,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We cannot accept their food.</b></font>

130
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is that a grimoire?</b></font>

131
00:10:00,310 --> 00:10:01,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] Uh, unfortunately not.</b></font>

132
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:04,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a notebook we received
from a traveling merchant</b></font>

133
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>some time ago.</b></font>

134
00:10:05,770 --> 00:10:07,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We have no use for it.</b></font>

135
00:10:07,690 --> 00:10:09,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

136
00:10:14,740 --> 00:10:16,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[scribbling]</b></font>

137
00:10:17,530 --> 00:10:18,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
I have a question, Himmel.</b></font>

138
00:10:19,950 --> 00:10:22,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why demand payment
in exchange for our aid,</b></font>

139
00:10:22,290 --> 00:10:24,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when you don't care
what we receive?</b></font>

140
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:27,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If they pay us,
they don't owe us anything.</b></font>

141
00:10:27,290 --> 00:10:29,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No favors and no praise.</b></font>

142
00:10:30,170 --> 00:10:32,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After all, we are
the party of heroes.</b></font>

143
00:10:37,390 --> 00:10:39,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're meant to be
protectors of the people,</b></font>

144
00:10:39,810 --> 00:10:42,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>not collectors
of gratitude and debt.</b></font>

145
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:44,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should give, not take.</b></font>

146
00:10:44,390 --> 00:10:45,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

147
00:10:48,570 --> 00:10:51,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If the people we help
are indebted to us,</b></font>

148
00:10:52,150 --> 00:10:55,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then the only people that we're
truly serving are ourselves.</b></font>

149
00:10:57,030 --> 00:10:58,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You see?</b></font>

150
00:10:58,200 --> 00:11:00,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why even
the most ridiculous spells</b></font>

151
00:11:00,330 --> 00:11:02,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>suffice as payment in my eyes.</b></font>

152
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:04,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Noble.</b></font>

153
00:11:06,540 --> 00:11:09,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Now start thinking
of a good tongue twister.</b></font>

154
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:12,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] I still think
you just want more grimoires.</b></font>

155
00:11:13,010 --> 00:11:15,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Next time,
maybe you can ask for one</b></font>

156
00:11:15,340 --> 00:11:17,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that prevents dragons
from biting your head.</b></font>

157
00:11:22,850 --> 00:11:24,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

158
00:11:24,730 --> 00:11:27,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN]
What's your analysis, Frieren?</b></font>

159
00:11:27,310 --> 00:11:28,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is it letting up?</b></font>

160
00:11:29,770 --> 00:11:30,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] It still looks like</b></font>

161
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:33,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we won't be able
to head out for a while.</b></font>

162
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:35,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN]
That's some terrible luck.</b></font>

163
00:11:35,780 --> 00:11:38,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't believe
we're stuck here.</b></font>

164
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:40,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm so bored, I could die.</b></font>

165
00:11:40,490 --> 00:11:42,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Blame the bottle ache,
not the boredom.</b></font>

166
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:43,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Himmel chuckles]</b></font>

167
00:11:44,290 --> 00:11:45,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

168
00:11:49,250 --> 00:11:51,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Keep your spirits high,
my brave friends!</b></font>

169
00:11:51,790 --> 00:11:53,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're on
a life-changing adventure</b></font>

170
00:11:53,510 --> 00:11:55,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to slay the Demon King.</b></font>

171
00:11:55,260 --> 00:11:58,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] Yet we haven't been
able to adventure for days now.</b></font>

172
00:11:59,010 --> 00:12:01,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Adventures are about
more than fighting</b></font>

173
00:12:01,510 --> 00:12:03,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and wandering pebbled roads.</b></font>

174
00:12:04,100 --> 00:12:06,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sometimes, an adventure
can be enduring</b></font>

175
00:12:06,060 --> 00:12:08,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a series
of dreadful days indoors.</b></font>

176
00:12:08,270 --> 00:12:11,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] Dreadful is your word,
not ours.</b></font>

177
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Himmel gasps]</b></font>

178
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:15,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] What are you
thrashing about for?</b></font>

179
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:17,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Has death come
to catch you, too?</b></font>

180
00:12:17,610 --> 00:12:18,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] Uh...</b></font>

181
00:12:18,700 --> 00:12:20,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thunder rumbling]</b></font>

182
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:22,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] It's nothing.</b></font>

183
00:12:27,790 --> 00:12:30,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've been waiting
around this city for a week</b></font>

184
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:32,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the weather still
hasn't gotten better.</b></font>

185
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:43,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Will you be able
to ferry us across today?</b></font>

186
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:45,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You must know the answer.</b></font>

187
00:12:53,810 --> 00:12:56,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though made of wood,
my boat is not a coffin.</b></font>

188
00:12:58,610 --> 00:13:00,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I suppose not.</b></font>

189
00:13:02,780 --> 00:13:04,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've heard of storms
over oceans,</b></font>

190
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:07,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I didn't know
they can form over lakes, too.</b></font>

191
00:13:07,450 --> 00:13:10,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Lake Korridor
is the largest body of water</b></font>

192
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:11,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in all the northern lands.</b></font>

193
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:14,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's larger than
some inland seas.</b></font>

194
00:13:14,670 --> 00:13:15,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] I believe it.</b></font>

195
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:17,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can hardly make out
the far shore.</b></font>

196
00:13:20,130 --> 00:13:21,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Immense mountain ranges</b></font>

197
00:13:21,590 --> 00:13:24,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to both the east and the west
disrupt air currents,</b></font>

198
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:27,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>making this time of year
brutally stormy.</b></font>

199
00:13:28,020 --> 00:13:30,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not uncommon
for large, established ships</b></font>

200
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:32,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to sink in this season.</b></font>

201
00:13:32,190 --> 00:13:33,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
And because of the wind,</b></font>

202
00:13:33,810 --> 00:13:36,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there's no chance we can cross
with flying magic.</b></font>

203
00:13:36,230 --> 00:13:37,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
It would be difficult to fly</b></font>

204
00:13:37,730 --> 00:13:39,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the other side
on a clear day.</b></font>

205
00:13:39,650 --> 00:13:43,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The distance to shore
is vaster than you think.</b></font>

206
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:45,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
I might be able to make it.</b></font>

207
00:13:45,580 --> 00:13:48,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But skilled as you are,
you lack the mana.</b></font>

208
00:13:48,620 --> 00:13:51,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Perhaps we would be better off
venturing around the lake.</b></font>

209
00:13:51,910 --> 00:13:54,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] We most certainly
would not be.</b></font>

210
00:13:54,710 --> 00:13:56,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, why?</b></font>

211
00:13:56,290 --> 00:13:59,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I told you about the mountains
to the east and the west.</b></font>

212
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:01,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[muffled] Mmm.</b></font>

213
00:14:01,090 --> 00:14:03,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're as mighty as the lake.</b></font>

214
00:14:03,220 --> 00:14:04,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Trying to barrel
our way through</b></font>

215
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:06,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without so much
as a mountain pass</b></font>

216
00:14:06,220 --> 00:14:07,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to hang our hats on...</b></font>

217
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:08,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[muffled] Mmm.</b></font>

218
00:14:09,060 --> 00:14:10,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>...would be suicide.</b></font>

219
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:13,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should stay put and wait
for a few months.</b></font>

220
00:14:13,730 --> 00:14:15,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It'll be leagues safer
and timelier</b></font>

221
00:14:15,690 --> 00:14:18,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>than challenging the elements
head on with no plan.</b></font>

222
00:14:19,110 --> 00:14:21,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fortunately, this is
a fairly large port city</b></font>

223
00:14:21,700 --> 00:14:23,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and trading hub.</b></font>

224
00:14:23,070 --> 00:14:25,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's the perfect place
to pass the time.</b></font>

225
00:14:28,660 --> 00:14:30,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

226
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:10,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] One winter later
and here we are.</b></font>

227
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can you take us?</b></font>

228
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:13,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes.</b></font>

229
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:17,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But only if you're able to pay.</b></font>

230
00:15:17,290 --> 00:15:19,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even though
the storms have passed,</b></font>

231
00:15:19,420 --> 00:15:21,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this voyage is not a safe one.</b></font>

232
00:15:22,300 --> 00:15:24,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The risk will need to be
worth it.</b></font>

233
00:15:27,340 --> 00:15:29,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's almost offensive.</b></font>

234
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:33,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'd have the funds if someone
hadn't bought so many grimoires.</b></font>

235
00:15:33,140 --> 00:15:35,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Boredom took control.</b></font>

236
00:15:35,930 --> 00:15:39,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fine. If you can't pay,
we'll exchange favors.</b></font>

237
00:15:39,310 --> 00:15:41,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>On an island just offshore,</b></font>

238
00:15:42,020 --> 00:15:44,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there's an abandoned monastery.</b></font>

239
00:15:44,110 --> 00:15:46,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's protected by a barrier.</b></font>

240
00:15:46,700 --> 00:15:48,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>According to legend,
if you can get through,</b></font>

241
00:15:49,030 --> 00:15:51,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'll find the memoirs
of Himmel the Hero.</b></font>

242
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:53,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In my grandfather's time,</b></font>

243
00:15:53,870 --> 00:15:57,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Himmel the Hero saved our city
and its people.</b></font>

244
00:15:57,710 --> 00:16:00,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've looked up to him
ever since I was a child.</b></font>

245
00:16:01,460 --> 00:16:04,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've been starving
for those memoirs for ages.</b></font>

246
00:16:04,590 --> 00:16:07,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd like you
to find them for me.</b></font>

247
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:09,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Himmel's memoirs, huh?</b></font>

248
00:16:10,050 --> 00:16:11,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Poor Himmel.</b></font>

249
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:13,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All that work to record
your travels</b></font>

250
00:16:13,850 --> 00:16:15,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>just for the pages to slip away.</b></font>

251
00:16:15,970 --> 00:16:17,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Must have been
very disappointing.</b></font>

252
00:16:21,940 --> 00:16:25,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't believe they've been
hiding there this whole while.</b></font>

253
00:16:25,740 --> 00:16:26,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sure.</b></font>

254
00:16:26,990 --> 00:16:29,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've got yourself
a favor.</b></font>

255
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:32,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

256
00:16:52,090 --> 00:16:54,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It feels like
we're on the ocean.</b></font>

257
00:16:54,350 --> 00:16:56,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is that a whole fleet of ships?</b></font>

258
00:16:56,220 --> 00:16:57,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Indeed.</b></font>

259
00:16:57,390 --> 00:16:59,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you want to move people
or goods north,</b></font>

260
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:01,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>now is the best time to do it.</b></font>

261
00:17:02,060 --> 00:17:04,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the recent rumors
are playing a role.</b></font>

262
00:17:04,690 --> 00:17:06,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They say there's a Golden Land</b></font>

263
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:08,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>where things from streets
to rooftops</b></font>

264
00:17:08,070 --> 00:17:09,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are made of pure gold.</b></font>

265
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:11,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>More people are interested</b></font>

266
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:13,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in crossing the lake
than normal.</b></font>

267
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:14,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A Golden Land?</b></font>

268
00:17:14,910 --> 00:17:16,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You think it really exists?</b></font>

269
00:17:16,830 --> 00:17:18,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sailor chuckles] Who can say?</b></font>

270
00:17:18,710 --> 00:17:20,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All I know is
I've never met anyone</b></font>

271
00:17:20,670 --> 00:17:22,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who's actually been there.</b></font>

272
00:17:22,630 --> 00:17:24,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Probably just another tall tale.</b></font>

273
00:17:28,590 --> 00:17:30,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SAILOR] There's the island.</b></font>

274
00:17:42,900 --> 00:17:46,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was expecting the barrier
to be much stronger.</b></font>

275
00:17:46,060 --> 00:17:48,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In its defense,
it must be several decades old.</b></font>

276
00:17:48,940 --> 00:17:51,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I bet this monastery was nice.</b></font>

277
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:53,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why would anybody abandon it?</b></font>

278
00:17:53,950 --> 00:17:55,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A monster attacked</b></font>

279
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:57,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the old roof couldn't
weather the damage.</b></font>

280
00:17:57,580 --> 00:17:59,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This place has been around
for a long while.</b></font>

281
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:01,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That makes sense.</b></font>

282
00:18:01,660 --> 00:18:04,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And explains why they erected
the barrier in a hurry.</b></font>

283
00:18:04,710 --> 00:18:05,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mm, and why was that?</b></font>

284
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:08,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Monasteries are known
to house books.</b></font>

285
00:18:08,460 --> 00:18:11,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Especially ones that are old,
valuable, and irreplaceable.</b></font>

286
00:18:11,930 --> 00:18:13,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] So, uh...</b></font>

287
00:18:13,890 --> 00:18:15,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
So they put up the barrier</b></font>

288
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:18,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to protect the books
they couldn't take with them.</b></font>

289
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:22,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That should do it.</b></font>

290
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:25,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, let's see what we can find.</b></font>

291
00:18:27,690 --> 00:18:29,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
What happened to the monks?</b></font>

292
00:18:29,610 --> 00:18:30,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where did they go?</b></font>

293
00:18:31,530 --> 00:18:32,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SAILOR] Who knows?</b></font>

294
00:18:32,990 --> 00:18:35,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was abandoned ages ago.</b></font>

295
00:18:35,280 --> 00:18:37,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The only knowledge that remains
about this place</b></font>

296
00:18:37,580 --> 00:18:40,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is the legend
of Himmel the Hero's memoirs.</b></font>

297
00:18:40,620 --> 00:18:42,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

298
00:18:44,710 --> 00:18:46,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door creaks open]</b></font>

299
00:18:50,710 --> 00:18:53,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] This library is massive.</b></font>

300
00:18:53,380 --> 00:18:55,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] There's a statue
of Mr. Himmel.</b></font>

301
00:18:56,220 --> 00:18:58,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He nailed the pose
for that one.</b></font>

302
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern gasps softly]</b></font>

303
00:19:00,770 --> 00:19:02,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

304
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:08,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Hello, book.</b></font>

305
00:19:08,270 --> 00:19:09,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is it you?</b></font>

306
00:19:09,820 --> 00:19:11,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

307
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:15,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes.</b></font>

308
00:19:15,070 --> 00:19:16,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is it.</b></font>

309
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:18,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's Himmel's handwriting.</b></font>

310
00:19:19,280 --> 00:19:20,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

311
00:20:17,630 --> 00:20:19,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] What does it say?</b></font>

312
00:20:21,390 --> 00:20:24,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's the tale
of a ridiculous journey.</b></font>

313
00:20:27,190 --> 00:20:29,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just everyday minutiae.</b></font>

314
00:20:31,310 --> 00:20:34,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Here. I hope that you enjoy it.</b></font>

315
00:20:34,190 --> 00:20:36,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At last, our fare
is paid in full.</b></font>

316
00:20:39,570 --> 00:20:42,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've heard plenty of stories
about the elven mage</b></font>

317
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:44,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who traveled
with the party of heroes,</b></font>

318
00:20:44,660 --> 00:20:46,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I never dreamed
I'd meet her.</b></font>

319
00:20:47,500 --> 00:20:49,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, what gave it away?</b></font>

320
00:20:49,670 --> 00:20:51,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The wistful look
that came to your face</b></font>

321
00:20:51,790 --> 00:20:53,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when you skimmed over the book.</b></font>

322
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:56,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can tell that
it's important to you.</b></font>

323
00:20:56,340 --> 00:20:58,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should keep it.</b></font>

324
00:21:00,220 --> 00:21:02,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There are plenty
of other valuable books</b></font>

325
00:21:02,300 --> 00:21:03,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>tucked away in here.</b></font>

326
00:21:04,470 --> 00:21:06,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's payment enough for me.</b></font>

327
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:10,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did it actually
show on my face?</b></font>

328
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:12,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Only a little.</b></font>

329
00:21:12,860 --> 00:21:14,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SAILOR] Let's be off.</b></font>

330
00:21:14,150 --> 00:21:16,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'll reach the far shore
before sunset.</b></font>

331
00:21:21,610 --> 00:21:22,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Mm...</b></font>

332
00:21:22,910 --> 00:21:25,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A collection of catchphrases.
[sighs]</b></font>

333
00:21:25,410 --> 00:21:28,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My! What a waste
of good pages.</b></font>

334
00:21:28,250 --> 00:21:29,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hang on, I wanna try!</b></font>

335
00:21:29,910 --> 00:21:32,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"I hope you brought
your coin purse, beast.</b></font>

336
00:21:32,170 --> 00:21:35,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For I, Stark the Warrior,
shall make you pay!"</b></font>

337
00:21:38,340 --> 00:21:39,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Uh...</b></font>

338
00:21:40,090 --> 00:21:42,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SAILOR] It's a kraken!</b></font>

339
00:21:42,050 --> 00:21:44,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] There are
sea monsters in a lake?</b></font>

340
00:21:44,680 --> 00:21:46,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Your yelling provoked it.</b></font>

341
00:21:46,560 --> 00:21:48,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're kidding!</b></font>

342
00:21:48,220 --> 00:21:50,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Think fast.
If we don't defeat it quickly,</b></font>

343
00:21:51,020 --> 00:21:53,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we shall all meet
a watery grave.</b></font>

344
00:21:53,980 --> 00:21:56,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[FERN] Mistress Frieren!
-[STARK] Frieren!</b></font>

345
00:21:58,230 --> 00:22:00,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're weak to well-placed
welts with...</b></font>

346
00:22:00,280 --> 00:22:02,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey! Huh?</b></font>

347
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:05,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, slaying a serpent is
as simple as it seems, sonny.</b></font>

348
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:07,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I get it.</b></font>

349
00:22:07,700 --> 00:22:09,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's picked now
to test her spell</b></font>

350
00:22:09,330 --> 00:22:10,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that allows you
to say tongue twisters</b></font>

351
00:22:10,870 --> 00:22:12,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without tripping
over your words.</b></font>

352
00:22:12,410 --> 00:22:13,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Huh?</b></font>

353
00:22:13,790 --> 00:22:16,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our lives are on the line
and you two are worried</b></font>

354
00:22:16,130 --> 00:22:17,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about tongue twisters?</b></font>

355
00:22:17,590 --> 00:22:18,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Creepy.</b></font>

356
00:22:19,880 --> 00:22:22,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

357
00:23:49,930 --> 00:23:52,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
It's 3,000 - meter drop.</b></font>

358
00:23:52,180 --> 00:23:54,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Mistress,
it's reacting to our mana.</b></font>

359
00:23:54,060 --> 00:23:56,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] If we defeat
the Demon King,</b></font>

360
00:23:56,060 --> 00:23:58,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a time will come when anyone
can enjoy this beautiful sight.</b></font>

